          "en": "So at the moment, it's not really looking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 355.02,
          "end": 357.47,
          "en": "like a better way of writing code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 357.47,
